.TH "TUSK" "1" "Jul 2026" "Tusk" "Tusk Manual"

.SH NAME
tusk-claude-uninstall - Remove the Claude Code plugin from this workspace


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBtusk claude uninstall [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Remove /.claude/skills/tusk/ and the plugin's MCP approval from
\&.claude/settings.local.json. A .mcp.json entry install migrated is not
restored; re-add it with:

.PP
claude mcp add --scope project tusk -- tusk mcp


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for uninstall


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB-v\fP, \fB--verbose\fP[=false]
	emit debug-level logs to stderr


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBtusk-claude(1)\fP
